WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.086 --> 00:00:15.108
took the photo out of his pocket.

2
00:00:15.128 --> 00:00:19.630
"I think it's almost time for us to go home," he said.

3
00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:23.012
Vinnie pointed to the glowing object.

4
00:00:23.672 --> 00:00:24.993
It was glowing blue.

5
00:00:25.013 --> 00:00:27.114
"But what is it?"

6
00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:30.196
asked Mandy, looking at the photo.

7
00:00:31.476 --> 00:00:33.617
"They are coming," said Magua.

8
00:00:34.158 --> 00:00:35.958
He pointed to the village gate.

9
00:00:36.979 --> 00:00:39.901
A long line of chiefs slowly walked in.

10
00:00:41.121 --> 00:00:43.282
Each wore his traditional headdress.

11
00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:47.224
Mandy was amazed by their colorful clothes.

12
00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:50.406
"Should we hide?"

13
00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:52.147
whispered Mandy.

14
00:00:52.707 --> 00:00:54.008
But it was too late.

15
00:00:55.189 --> 00:00:58.130
One of the chiefs stopped when he saw the children.

16
00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:02.272
"The enemy stands on our land," he said.

17
00:01:03.633 --> 00:01:05.093
Vinnie gulped loudly.

18
00:01:05.633 --> 00:01:07.674
Mandy felt tears in her eyes.

19
00:01:07.694 --> 00:01:13.235
"We are a peaceful people," Clan Mother said.

20
00:01:13.255 --> 00:01:17.136
"Remember Hiawatha's wampum belt."

21
00:01:18.637 --> 00:01:24.118
"Yes, it is the belt of harmony among the Iroquois," the chief said to Clan Mother.

22
00:01:24.138 --> 00:01:26.899
"But not harmony with the whites!"

23
00:01:27.599 --> 00:01:29.500
He pointed to Vinnie and Mandy.

24
00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:34.662
"These children have done no harm to us," said Clan Mother.

25
00:01:34.682 --> 00:01:37.764
"What is a wampum belt?"

26
00:01:38.384 --> 00:01:39.285
whispered Vinnie.

27
00:01:39.305 --> 00:01:43.267
"A wampum belt is made of small beads made from shells.

28
00:01:44.468 --> 00:01:48.530
It is very important for the Iroquois," explained Magua.

29
00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:53.712
"Hiawatha's belt was made long ago when the Five Nations was first formed."

30
00:01:56.074 --> 00:02:00.156
Respectfully, Magua and Onatah came up to the chief.

31
00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.062
"It is true," they said.

32
00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:05.764
"Vinnie and Mandy came in peace."

33
00:02:07.165 --> 00:02:11.669
Vinnie and Mandy were very moved by the words of their new friends.

34
00:02:11.689 --> 00:02:17.955
"They're trying to help us, Vinnie," said Mandy, wiping her eyes.

35
00:02:17.975 --> 00:02:19.656
"Very well.

36
00:02:20.096 --> 00:02:22.719
The children may stay," said the chief.

37
00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.242
Onatah walked back to Mandy and Vinnie.

38
00:02:26.882 --> 00:02:28.724
Magua stood behind the chief.

39
00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:34.681
It took a very long time for all the chiefs to gather around the fire.

40
00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:39.523
"Sorrow has come to our people," one of the chiefs said.

41
00:02:39.543 --> 00:02:44.844
"There is a time for peace and a time for battle," said another.

42
00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:50.546
"Oh, Vinnie," whispered Mandy, "there's going to be war."

43
00:02:50.566 --> 00:02:55.667
"The Iroquois will not be divided," said another chief.

44
00:02:55.687 --> 00:02:58.528
"We must stand strong against the whites."

45
00:02:59.616 --> 00:03:03.059
He held up a purple and white belt in both hands.

46
00:03:03.079 --> 00:03:06.721
"Wow!" cried Vinnie.

47
00:03:06.741 --> 00:03:09.123
"That's Hiawatha's belt!

48
00:03:09.903 --> 00:03:11.805
It's the one Magua told me about."

49
00:03:13.286 --> 00:03:16.608
The belt was decorated with white and purple shells.

50
00:03:16.628 --> 00:03:21.972
"The Great Tree of Peace is in the center of it," said Onatah.

51
00:03:21.992 --> 00:03:27.696
"And the row of white shells is like a path for anyone who seeks peace."

52
00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.263
"The Iroquois want peace," the chief said.

53
00:03:32.283 --> 00:03:35.726
"But if we must fight, we will fight as one people!"

54
00:03:36.667 --> 00:03:39.449
Everyone cheered.

55
00:03:39.469 --> 00:03:41.831
"Vinnie! The photo!

56
00:03:42.111 --> 00:03:43.332
The wampum belt!"

57
00:03:43.873 --> 00:03:44.754
cried Mandy.

58
00:03:46.035 --> 00:03:49.538
Sure enough, the belt in the photo was glowing red.

59
00:03:50.659 --> 00:03:52.721
Mandy looked around for her friend.

60
00:03:53.681 --> 00:03:56.464
But Onatah had disappeared into the crowd.

61
00:03:58.124 --> 00:04:02.890
"Come on, Mandy," Vinnie said, gently taking his sister's hand.

62
00:04:05.593 --> 00:04:07.535
They fell down the dark tunnel.

63
00:04:11.399 --> 00:04:13.221
The children opened their eyes.

64
00:04:13.882 --> 00:04:15.103
They were in the attic.

65
00:04:16.345 --> 00:04:19.008
At that moment, Dad opened the door.
